{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CetJW71nLzEtoFp3cPPRW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Command run:** `./mvnw test` from `sample-service/`\n\n**Result:** BUILD SUCCESS\n- Tests run: 17, Failures: 0, Errors: 0, Skipped: 0\n- ShipmentControllerTest: 9 tests (5 existing + 4 new)\n- All existing tests pass\n- All new tests pass\n\n---\n\n```\n<<PHASE:REVIEW>>\n```\n\n**Acceptance criteria mapping:**\n\n1. ✓ **Existing build passes** – BUILD SUCCESS with `./mvnw test`\n2. ✓ **Existing tests pass** – All 5 original ShipmentControllerTest tests still pass\n3. ✓ **POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm confirms a created shipment and persists it** – Test `confirms a CREATED shipment moves it to CONFIRMED` verifies transition and response\n4. ✓ **Error responses are consistent with the rest of this API** – Uses ResourceNotFoundException (404) and ConflictException (409) following OrderController pattern; GlobalExceptionHandler formats errors\n5. ✓ **A repeated confirm succeeds; a cancelled shipment is refused; an unknown id is refused** – Tests `confirm is idempotent for CONFIRMED shipment`, `rejecting confirm of CANCELLED shipment`, `rejecting confirm of non-existent shipment`\n6. ✓ **No new Maven dependency appears** – pom.xml unchanged; only used existing Spring Boot and Kotlin libraries\n7. ✓ **No unrelated production file changes** – Only modified ShipmentController, ApiError, and ShipmentControllerTest; no other production files touched\n\n**Diff review:**\n\n1. **ApiError.kt**: Added `SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATUS` to ErrorCode enum (line 35). Required because the 409 conflict case for cancelled shipments needs a distinct error code per API contract.\n\n2. **ShipmentController.kt**: Added `confirm()` method (lines 58-77). Required to implement the endpoint. Uses when-expression to handle three status cases (CREATED→save, CONFIRMED→return unchanged, CANCELLED→throw). Returns the shipment di